<title>FRANCE: Paribas buys stake in Bormiolo Rocco.</title>
<headline>Paribas buys stake in Bormiolo Rocco.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>French holding Groupe Paribas said on Thursday its Paribas Affaires Industrielles unit had bought an 11.9 percent stake in Italy's Bormioli Rocco.</p>
<p>It also announced in a statement that the Italian firm had at the same time bought a drinks glass making business from Saint-Gobain, except for the activities in South America.</p>
<p>Saint-Gobain announced its divestment to the Italian firm in a separate statement issued around the same time.</p>
<p>No prices were given in either statement.</p>
</text>
